# onService PH: instructions for Cursor

This file is only a pointer. The rules for every AI coder live in `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root.
Read `CLAUDE.md` in full before any work, then the checkpoint it names (`.ai-coder/CURRENT-DISPATCH`).
Philippine conventions, security basics, test discipline, hard stops and what needs Ken are all in `CLAUDE.md`.
GitHub enforces nothing on this repo (protection is off by Ken's choice). Never claim otherwise.

